### Register customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MVP User",
  "phone": "03009998877",
  "cnic": "42101-8888888-8",
  "email": "mvp@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "03009998877",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Search trains
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/search?from=Karachi%20Cantt&to=Lahore%20Jn&date=2026-09-21

### Seat details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/1/seats?coachClass=AC_BUSINESS

### Lock selected seats for 10 minutes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/seat-allocations/lock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "seatIds": [11]
}

### Confirm booking (replace userId and lockToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "lockToken": "lock-token-from-previous-response",
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerName": "Ali Khan",
      "cnicOrBForm": "42101-1234567-1",
      "age": 30,
      "gender": "MALE"
    }
  ]
}

### Get booking by PNR
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/pnr/PNR-REPLACE-ME

### Pay booking (mock payment)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/pay

### Booking history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/user/1

### Cancel booking
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/cancel
